        "q": "How much money must cardholders spend with their Biz Black credit card to receive the 5X reward points?",
        "a": "To avail the benefit of 5X rewards, i.e. 25 reward points per Rs. 150 spent, the HDFC Biz Black cardholders must reach the minimum monthly card spends worth Rs. 50,000."
